id: steadfast-warrior
name: Steadfast Warrior
talentCategory: threshold
prerequisites: Fortitude, ToP3+
description: >
  You are an absolute unit, an unstoppable force that keeps barreling towards your enemies regardless of the damage they deal to you.
text: >
  Steadfast Warrior: You are an absolute unit, an unstoppable force that keeps barreling towards your enemies regardless of the damage they deal to you.
  –Prerequisites: Fortitude, ToP3+
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Maximum Life Points by 2 for each of your Power Levels.
  (2)-[Passive]: When rolling a Steadfast Check, roll your Base Die twice and take the highest result.

---

[passive]
# (1) As Diehard's and Fortitude's: 2 for each Power Level.
life.perLevel += 2;
# (2) Every Steadfast Check's die 2d10, the highest kept - rerolled the same way (actor-character.mjs steadfast).
allow steadfast.baseDieTwice;
